2026-07-27T09:27:45.2179328Z i /tmp/RtmpYai4RY/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:27:45.2179800Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:27:45.2180640Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:27:45.2181191Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:27:45.2181967Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:27:45.2183204Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:27:45.2184478Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
